[statement]
A name the world names, though not the request, gives way to a requested
name as any other name does (`conflicts/a-later-name-gives-way-to-a-requested-name-its-best-candidate-forbids`):
`e` 2, installed for the world, forbids `w`, which `b` 2, requested,
provides. apk installs `b` 2 and downgrades `e` to 1.

[repository]
P:b
V:2
p:w=2

P:e
V:2
D:!w

P:e
V:1

[installed]
P:e
V:2
D:!w

[world]
e

[request]
b

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install b 2
downgrade e 2 1
